      "index": 5715,
      "raw_answer": "-14 + (-8) + 1 = <<-14+-8+1=-21>>-21 degrees Fahrenheit\n-21/3 = <<-21/3=-7>>-7 degrees Fahrenheit\nThe average temperature was -7 degrees Fahrenheit.\n#### -7"
