    {
      "file": "gsm8k-train.arrow",
      "index": 5844,
      "raw_answer": "Let N = smallest number\nN + 2 = next number\nN + 4 = largest number\nN + (N + 2) + (N + 4) = -147\n3N + 6 = -147\n3N = <<-153=-153>>-153\nN = -51\nThe largest number is <<-47=-47>>-47.\n#### -47"
    },
    {
      "file": "gsm8k-train.arrow",
      "index": 6189,
      "raw_answer": "-36 + 13 + (-15) + (-10) = <<-36+13+-15+-10=-48>>-48 degrees Fahrenheit\n-48/4 = <<-48/4=-12>>-12 degrees Fahrenheit\nThe average temperature was -12 degrees Fahrenheit.\n#### -12"
    },
    {
      "file": "gsm8k-test.arrow",
      "index": 489,
      "raw_answer": "-48 + 21 + (-3) = <<-48+21+(-3)=-30>>-30\n-30/3 = <<-30/3=-10>>-10 degrees\nThe average highest temperature recorded in Southlandia, Northlandia, and Midlandia is -10 degrees Fahrenheit.\n#### -10"
    },
    {
