      "raw_answer": "Start = +<<2=2>>2 degrees\nDrop 8 degrees = 2 - 8 = -6 degrees\nIncrease 3 degrees = -6 + 3 = -3 degrees\nIt was -3 degrees Celsius in the morning.\n#### -3"
